1557	 * Name: riscv_netinitialize
1558	 *
1559	 * Description:
1560	 *   Arch-level network initialization called from up_initialize().
1561	 *   Initializes the SG2000 Ethernet driver.
1562	 *
1563	 ****************************************************************************/
